<title>India: Kashmir, Manipur and the Maoist belt: the situation</title>
<link>https://map.igred.org/crisis/india/</link>
<guid isPermaLink="false">igred-summary-india-2026-11-04T15:37:13.678Z</guid>
<pubDate>Wed, 04 Nov 2026 15:37:13 GMT</pubDate>
<description>&lt;p&gt;Armed clashes continue in Manipur, with rival Naga and other insurgent groups fighting in Noney district, resulting in multiple militants killed and weapons seized. In Jammu and Kashmir, a military vehicle fell into a gorge in Ladakh, killing two army personnel, while authorities pursued a terror-financing probe that led to searches of four locations. The chief minister of Manipur warned armed groups that UAPA action will follow civilian violence and sought reports on groups linked to recent attacks. The UCDP recorded 437 battle-related deaths in 2024, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;The Hindu&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Frontline Magazine&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiqgFBVV95cUxNNEYzVE4tX0UtTXlSS0s0RTFkdTB5SDRzX3U4ZDRmU0JhRXAyNFBRNE9MR3hTSEtaVktUMnYxZ1ZtSlZUREgyRWJ1RFNoQUFfeDRmdGJBaUlES2RNbDM1TkhXZ001QkpRdTRnQk1QOGFSVktoTllGZjJnSFFfcXAtTEFleThGbHRmTkRxaFIyLWNPZFI5emZsWHYxajZOLV8wQ2xVREFtX0xsdw?oc=5&quot;&gt;Kashmir Life&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMirwFBVV95cUxOVWEyejdlVGI4aWVoM2c4aUpRa1hoRGhwRG1BQXhrTWlZZEhrRUJkTWhFZEdhQWNkVXRMbWtnTWZGYzlWT3NXQTR4Tk5NQ25lckhiellZZE1OcTc3STNoWFJvOGl0ZW1PLXpxTnMzS3d2YlI2UTZtbGtkUUJqZDZNcDlvaHJ4Y3UyYTc1MjJ2dUEtLXZ3YWFKUmtXTTRlWTdEOHhUQ2lZSUNnSWcyR3ZF?oc=5&quot;&gt;Northeast Live&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiuAFBVV95cUxNSlRBWG9KZnpFZU5BbEJLNC1OcXlyLVBQR3Z0UlRXcFJGM2ZWeTRydzQ1a29IZjE3b1VQY2YtS0JTcnJvcmhOQk1jSW56blJpUEdkc3BNZUlpTTRyd2l0d195MkhPZFk4R2lzQW1KX0lBcmlwSkdBaGttVHNnamU1cVJ2MXN2QjY5QmxFaEZXc1N2MFF6eVRjbm9NNzNsSEpJaGRyM19rSW9NbUIwd21TZ2R6WHVad2N4?oc=5&quot;&gt;Ukhrul Times&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMijwFBVV95cUxOUWtWMWpYYjdzZm5uRll6RjN2dE9